    {
        n: '24',
        title: 'Changes to these Terms',
        body: [
            'We may update these Terms from time to time. For material changes we will give at least 14 days’ notice by email to the account owner or by a prominent notice in the Service, unless a shorter period is required by law or needed to address a security or legal issue. Non-material changes take effect when posted. Your continued use of the Service after the effective date constitutes acceptance. If you do not agree, you must stop using the Service and may cancel; we will refund any prepaid fees for the unused portion of your term if the change materially and adversely affects you.',
        ],
    },
    {
        n: '25',
        title: 'General terms',
        body: [
            {
                items: [
                    'Entire agreement. These Terms, our Privacy Policy, and any order or plan details you accept in the Service form the entire agreement between you and Memberley about the Service and supersede all prior agreements. Terms on your purchase orders or portals have no effect.',
                    'Assignment. You may not assign these Terms without our written consent. We may assign them in connection with a merger, acquisition, reorganization, or sale of assets, and will notify you if we do.',
                    'Notices. We may give notice by email to the addresses on your account or through the Service. Notices to us must be sent to the address in Section 26 and are effective on receipt.',
                    'Severability and waiver. If any provision is unenforceable, it will be modified to the minimum extent necessary and the rest remains in effect. Our failure to enforce a provision is not a waiver.',
